<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">08082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Turkey, Saudi Arabia and Pakistan have signed a collective defence pact in Mecca, pairing Pakistan's nuclear arsenal with Turkey's NATO-scale army and Saudi finance.</s> <s>Three of the Muslim world's largest militaries have committed to each other's defence without the American guarantee that shaped Gulf security for half a century.</s> <s>The published text discloses no command structure and no trigger for mutual response... which leaves the pact's most important question unanswered.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Houthi forces fired twelve missiles into Yemen's oil-producing provinces on Friday, after strikes a day earlier killed thirty soldiers around Marib.</s> <s>Marib has been the government's last significant revenue base since the war began, and its fields fund what remains of the state in Aden.</s> <s>The advance tightens the same forces' grip on Red Sea shipping, on the day Riyadh signed its new defence agreement.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Spain began checking travellers arriving from Italy at midnight, retaliating after Rome kept its own Schengen controls past a Spanish deadline.</s> <s>Two founding members of Europe's free-movement area are now policing each other, because Schengen has no arbiter empowered to end another member's temporary controls — so it erodes by tit-for-tat rather than by decision.</s> <s>The people at the centre of it barely appear: at least one thousand three hundred and forty-two children remain in Ceuta, the enclave on Moroccan soil, with neither government setting a date for anything.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Tanzania has moved to demarcate fifteen hundred square kilometres of Maasai village land in Loliondo, citing overgrazing.</s> <s>These are herders resettled onto this ground in nineteen fifty-nine, and the same rangeland is opening to tourism and hunting concessions — conservation status being the one land classification that's internationally legible and domestically unchallengeable.</s> <s>Residents say the twenty twenty-four decree that delisted their villages was issued without their consent, and the ecological condition being protected is the product of their own grazing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Volodymyr Zelenskyy has landed in Belgrade, the first such visit to the one European capital that's refused throughout the war to sanction Moscow.</s> <s>Serbia's factories have supplied, by indirect routes, a large share of the artillery ammunition Ukraine fires — Belgrade sells the shells and withholds the politics.</s> <s>President Aleksandar Vučić says that position predates the visit and won't change, which is how a small state monetises non-alignment.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Families displaced from Pakistan's Tirah Valley say the compensation promised when they left ahead of a military operation in December still hasn't arrived.</s> <s>Only twenty-one thousand of thirty-four thousand households have even been verified eight months on, and a return is scheduled for October.</s> <s>The return date is set by the security assessment rather than by whether homes exist to go back to — so the state's obligation expires on a timetable it writes itself.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A federal appeals court has halted above-ground construction on a four hundred million dollar ballroom at the White House, ruling two to one that reshaping the building needs congressional approval.</s> <s>Privately funded work on a public building has been the mechanism throughout, which is precisely what the court found insufficient.</s> <s>Its ruling is stayed for two weeks while the administration appeals to the Supreme Court.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In China, families are paying institutions to confine adult relatives, one held for eleven days without any medical order.</s> <s>These centres are licensed as education providers rather than medical facilities, so psychiatric commitment law — with its hearings and review — never applies at all.</s> <s>Former detainees have filed unlawful-detention complaints, and not one has yet produced a result.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The United States Senate has voted eighty-six to eleven for a bill that lets the president impose one hundred percent tariffs on the five largest buyers of Russian oil.</s> <s>The legislation names Russia but taxes India and China, which is the architecture of secondary sanctions: the cost falls on third countries that made no decision about the war.</s> <s>It goes to the House next, and the president's said he'll sign it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Food and Agriculture Organization's price index has climbed to one hundred and thirty-one point one.</s> <s>Attacks in the Black Sea and disruption at Hormuz raised freight costs in the same month that heatwaves cut European wheat yields — a shipping crisis and a harvest failure arriving together.</s> <s>The World Food Programme expects fifty million more people pushed into acute hunger by late twenty twenty-seven.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Crude from Iraq is now moving overland through Syria, because the blockade at Hormuz has made Damascus's geography valuable again.</s> <s>Sea routes are cheap and land routes are costly, so a pipeline corridor only pays when the water closes — which is why this route has appeared and vanished repeatedly since the nineteen thirties.</s> <s>Gulf economies are contracting under the war even as Syria signs new investment deals.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's drug regulator has traced a counterfeit asthma inhaler, a fake copy of Pulmicort, to a single address in Obosi.</s> <s>A failed inhaler doesn't announce itself: it's discovered during an attack, when the medicine that should open the airway does nothing.</s> <s><sub alias="NAFDAC">NAFDAC</sub> has ordered nationwide mop-up operations while it works out how far the distribution network reached.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Mexico has counted more than five hundred human cases of screwworm since a containment barrier at the Panamanian border failed in twenty twenty-two.</s> <s>The parasite was eradicated across North America by nineteen ninety-nine and Central America by two thousand three, using sterile-fly releases that have to continue forever — stop, and the flies return.</s> <s>Researchers report the infestation rate tripled this year, with cases moving north.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A team at Stanford has used an artificial intelligence model to design sixteen working virus genomes, all of them bacteriophages that target bacteria rather than people.</s> <s>Phage genomes are small enough for a model to hold whole, which is why they came first, and the same constraint won't hold as models grow.</s> <s>Synthesis vendors screen orders voluntarily against known agents, and no international rule governs a sequence that has never existed before.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two kilometres below Sudbury, detectors are counting antineutrinos streaming out of decaying uranium, thorium and potassium inside the Earth.</s> <s>Particles that pass through rock untouched are the only messengers that can report from the mantle directly, and they're measuring how much of the planet's heat is radiogenic rather than left over from its formation.</s> <s>That single number sets the budget for mantle convection, which drives plate tectonics and the magnetic field that keeps the atmosphere attached.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India had GitHub geoblock the repository for Bitchat, a messenger that relays text over Bluetooth hops between nearby phones, needing no tower and no internet provider.</s> <s>Downloads surged during a network blackout, which is exactly the condition the app was built for — so the takedown reached past India's mobile networks to the source code itself.</s> <s>A shutdown that can't stop the messages can still remove the means of getting them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A judge in Santa Fe has ordered Meta to pay five hundred and sixty-seven million dollars, four hundred and twenty million of it funding treatment.</s> <s>The ruling locates the defect in the recommendation engine rather than in anything a user posted, which sidesteps the immunity shield that has ended nearly every case like it.</s> <s>Whether that reasoning travels to other courts is now the only question that matters.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Copernicus Browser has made infrared satellite bands a default layer, free and without licence, sharp enough to see fire fronts through smoke.</s> <s>Its resolution beats the two hundred and fifty metre imagery most fire monitoring has relied on, and the script behind it has existed for a decade without ever being switched on by default.</s> <s>Anybody with a connection can now check the burns officials report, from the Sahel to the Amazon, God willing without asking anyone's permission.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>